---
import {
  Wallet,
  Battery,
  Wrench,
  TrendingUp
} from "lucide-astro";

import Card from "./ui/Card.astro";
---

<section class="bg-slate-50 py-24">

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

    <!-- Heading -->

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

      <span class="rounded-full bg-orange-100 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-orange-600">
        Why Choose Solar8
      </span>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
        Helping Gauteng Homeowners Take Control of Their Energy Future
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-600">
        We design and install premium solar systems that reduce electricity
        costs, provide reliable backup power and deliver long-term value for
        homes and businesses across Gauteng.
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Cards -->

    <div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

      <Card title="Lower Monthly Bills">

        <span slot="icon" class="icon-circle">
          <Wallet size={42} strokeWidth={2.2} />
        </span>

        Generate more of your own electricity and reduce your monthly electricity
        costs with a professionally designed solar solution.

      </Card>

      <Card title="Reliable Backup Power">

        <span slot="icon" class="icon-circle">
          <Battery size={42} strokeWidth={2.2} />
        </span>

        Keep your home or business running during load shedding, cable theft,
        damaged substations and unexpected grid failures.

      </Card>

      <Card title="Professional Installation">

        <span slot="icon" class="icon-circle">
          <Wrench size={42} strokeWidth={2.2} />
        </span>

        Every installation is completed by experienced professionals using
        premium equipment from trusted global manufacturers.

      </Card>

      <Card title="Long-Term Investment">

        <span slot="icon" class="icon-circle">
          <TrendingUp size={42} strokeWidth={2.2} />
        </span>

        Lower future electricity costs while increasing the value and energy
        independence of your property.

      </Card>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->

    <div class="mt-20 text-center">

      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        Whether you're installing solar for the first time or upgrading an
        existing system, our team will recommend the right solution for your
        property and budget.
      </p>

      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-orange-600 hover:shadow-xl"
      >
        Request My FREE Solar Assessment
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<style>

.icon-circle{

    width:72px;
    height:72px;

    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;

    border-radius:9999px;

    background:#fff7ed;

    color:#f97316;

    margin-bottom:1rem;

}

</style>